WEBVTT

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:04.580
Why couldn't I beat him?

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.870
Is it because he's Yusyo Sakaki's son?

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.820
That's all the more reason 
that I must crush him.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.290
Those who say duels should bring smiles...

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:19.330
The kind of men who use Smile World...

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.390
I cannot lose to people like that!

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.300
The Aquaria Project.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:31.080
In their plan to create an ideal world, 
the Fusion Dimension's Academia

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:36.410
has driven Heartland City, in the Xyz 
Dimension, to the brink of obliteration.

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:14.980
Amazoness Trap

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:19.020
Just now, was that Sawatari?

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.010
Over there!

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:28.190
Gongenzaka! Sawatari!

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:30.660
What happened? Who did this?

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:33.470
Allen! Sayaka!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.230
A-Amazoness...

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:37.600
What?

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:41.130
What's this? New allies?

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.720
Are you the tag-team duelists who 
use an Amazoness deck?

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:56.700
At last, someone who recognizes us.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.720
So he must belong to the Resistance.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:02.430
Someone who ran in fear, 
rather than fighting us, I'm sure.

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:02.960
Shut—

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:04.100
Shut up!

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:07.800
That day, Syun and I just decided 
to act separately.

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:12.770
If we'd been there, we'd never have 
let you turn our allies into cards!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:15.840
What's going on?

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.270
Ute, you also know those two?

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:21.710
No, but I know the Resistance's Spade Branch

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:25.790
fought a pair of female duelists 
using an Amazoness deck,

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.220
and they were nearly all destroyed.

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:29.720
It's probably...

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.470
You think if you'd been there, 
you'd have saved them?

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.430
You certainly think highly of yourself.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.260
Yuya...

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:42.410
Yuya, they're the ones who took 
our Spade Branch allies!

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:43.870
I know.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:47.740
I feel your anger and sadness keenly.

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:50.860
But if we become slaves to our anger,

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:54.750
I think that unknown thing will 
start to rise within us again.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.650
I never want it to take me over again...

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.710
Yuya.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.560
Right now, let Ute do as he wishes.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.570
How could you tell?

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:09.930
I've known him longer than you.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:12.530
Ute probably feels the same as I do.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.240
We can't let them get away!

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.000
I understand.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.690
I can't forgive Academia, either.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:26.080
If we let them go, they'll turn 
more people into cards!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:30.080
But I'll fight the kind of duel I believe in!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:30.970
Is that okay?

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.060
Do as you wish.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:34.520
I'll use my own duel to crush them.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.690
That's right...

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:39.230
If I can see my kind of duel through, 
without losing myself,

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:41.390
no one will ever control my heart!

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.800
Field Spell Crossover.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.540
An Action Field? They're with 
the Lancers, as well?

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:54.650
You're fine with a tag-team deal, right?

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:58.510
With both sides sharing a 
field, life, and graveyard.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:00.290
Sharing a graveyard?

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:02.980
But that puts Gongenzaka 
at a huge disadvantage!

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:04.850
Oh, does it?

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:08.540
But he can use Action Cards, 
so I think we're even.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:12.690
Now, why not show us your true power?

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:16.290
I'll avenge Gongenzaka for the 
humiliation you put him through!

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:17.430
Duel!

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:19.740
I'll go first.

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:25.670
When there are no monsters on my field,
 I can activate Continuous Spell Quiet Life!

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:30.710
Its effect forbids players from 
Special Summoning on the

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:33.090
same turn as they Normal Summon.

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:34.550
The reverse is also true.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.250
And I activate my spell card Polymerization

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:43.420
to fuse Amazoness Queen and 
Amazoness Swords Woman in my hand.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.030
Queen of the jungle,

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:48.010
take on the gallant swords woman's power,

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.460
and build an empire to reign over all!

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:52.430
Fusion Summon!

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:56.770
Appear, Level 8 Amazoness Empress!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:02.110
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:11.180
Each turn, we have to choose either 
a Normal or Special Summon?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.970
Why set up a choice like that?

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.810
Regardless, there's only 
one choice, anyway!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:16.820
My turn!

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.610
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:26.910
with Scale 3 Performapal Turn Toad 
and Scale 8 Odd-Eyes Unicorn!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.880
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 4 and 7 simultaneously!

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.580
Yuya...

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:42.550
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:45.170
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:47.280
Pendulum Summon!

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.350
Appear in defense position,

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.960
Xiangsheng Magician!

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:57.160
And Performapal Monkeyboard, 
also in defense position!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.880
Appraising their style by summoning 
in defense position?

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:02.400
We must proceed carefully.

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:07.330
I activate Continuous Trap Amazoness Hall.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:10.560
When monsters are Special Summoned 
to your side of the field,

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:14.350
my life increases by the sum 
of their attack points.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.490
What?

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:17.660
The sum of their attack points?

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:23.890
No.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:29.080
The Professor directly ordered 
us to take out the Lancers.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:32.860
You really thought we wouldn't have any 
counter for Pendulum Summoning?

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.060
The Professor, directly?

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:36.860
I see.

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:39.340
That makes you all the more worth beating.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.420
Talk big while you still can.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.710
Now, end your turn already!

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:50.480
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:53.570
I think you're going to disappoint me, too.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.890
My turn!

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:59.900
I activate my spell card Polymerization,

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:04.830
and fuse Amazoness Tiger and 
Amazoness Spy in my hand!

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:07.600
Jungle beast, with bared claws,

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:10.060
take on the warrior's eyes who hunts for prey,

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:12.800
and return as a new ferocious beast!

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.940
Fusion Summon!

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:16.240
Appear,

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:19.660
Level 9 Amazoness Pet Liger!

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.420
Battle.

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:25.150
Amazoness Pet Liger attacks Monkeyboard!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:29.120
When this card attacks, its attack 
points increase by 500!

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:31.820
As long as Amazoness Empress 
is on the field,

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:35.420
when an Amazoness monster attacks 
a monster in defense position,

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:37.310
it deals piercing damage.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:45.170
Wait for us, Sawatari... Gongenzaka.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:49.410
When battle ends, Liger's attack 
points return to normal.

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:51.950
But it isn't over yet...

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:56.380
We're sharing a field, so Amazoness 
Empress is my monster, too.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:00.120
I attack Xiangsheng Magician 
with Amazon Empress!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:04.020
Take it, 1300 points of piercing damage!

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.110
Yuya...

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:11.360
Syun...

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:16.970
You aren't going for those special Action 
Cards of yours, to protect your allies?

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:20.470
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:24.910
If you want to enjoy yourselves 
that much, I'll oblige you.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:29.780
Alongside the souls of my allies, 
whom you turned into cards!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.900
No, Kurosaki...

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:33.450
Fight your own duel.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:37.390
The more we're forced back, 
the more we bare our fangs!

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:40.460
N-No, Ute... Don't be a slave to anger.

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:45.160
We'll show you the true opposition 
of the Resistance!

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:50.000
My turn!

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:56.720
I use the Pendulum Scale already 
set, to Pendulum Summon.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:57.890
Appear!

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:02.350
Three Raidraptor — Singing Laniuses.

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:05.750
In that instant, Amazoness Hall's effect adds

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:10.820
the total attack points of the monsters 
you Special Summoned to our life.

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:14.330
Their life increased again?

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:16.860
Yuya...

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.850
Kurosaki, don't rely on anger alone!

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:24.310
I overlay my three Level 4 Singing Laniuses!

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.210
Xyz Summon.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:31.680
Appear!

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:35.610
Rank 4 Raidraptor — Rise Falcon.

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.160
Again?

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:44.820
What's the point of all your weak 
monsters, with low attack points?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:49.790
I activate my Equip Spell Raidraptor — 
Iron Heart to Rise Falcon,

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.250
increasing its attack points by 500.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:55.270
It still only has 600 attack points.

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:58.140
This is when Rise Falcon 
shows its true worth!

00:10:58.140 --> 00:10:59.790
Don't do it, Kurosaki.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:01.340
Don't fight with anger alone!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:06.780
I use one Overlay Unit to activate 
Rise Falcon's effect!

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:09.690
It adds the sum of the attack points

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:13.620
of all the monsters Special Summoned 
to your field, to its own!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:14.650
What?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.090
It gets Liger and Empress's attack points?

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:27.770
5900 attack points...

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.100
Go!

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.280
Battle!

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:34.070
Rise Falcon, attack Amazoness Pet Liger.

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:36.640
Flame Claw Evolution!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:41.550
When Amazoness Empress 
is in faceup position...

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.520
...Amazoness monsters cannot be destroyed!

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:47.720
But you still take damage!

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:56.850
Syun's Rise Falcon can attack 
each monster once.

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:58.200
Go... Finish them, Syun!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:02.200
Rise Falcon attacks Amazoness Empress.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.230
It's no use!

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:05.930
When Liger is on the field,

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:08.890
attacks that target any 
other card are negated.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:13.980
No...

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:17.720
In that instant, Rise Falcon's 
attack points return to normal.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:23.650
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:26.730
Impressive that you've made 
it this far against us.

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:29.200
You aren't like the other 
Resistance members.

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:31.330
But too bad...

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:34.330
In the end, even that effort means nothing.

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:34.970
What?

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:39.870
I activate my set card! 
Continuous Trap Amazoness Hot Spring!

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:44.810
We can recover life equal to 
one instance of damage

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:47.010
that we sustained during a turn.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.720
All the life we took is back?

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:55.190
And one more... Continuous Trap 
Amazoness Magic Mirror!

00:12:55.570 --> 00:13:00.420
Once per turn, we can negate 
battle damage dealt to us!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.820
What?

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:03.630
Negating battle damage?

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.980
Haven't you learned yet?

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:07.930
You cannot beat us.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:11.590
Now, we'll send you to join your allies.

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.600
My turn!

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:14.710
Battle.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:18.190
Amazoness Pet Liger attacks Rise Falcon!

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:24.020
In that instant, Liger's monster effect 
increases its attack points by 500!

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.960
Quick-Play Spell Rank-Up-Magic

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:28.990
Escape Force!

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:33.200
I negate battle and Xyz Summon 
a monster, in attack position,

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:37.300
of one rank higher than 
its target, Rise Falcon.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:43.070
Rank-Up Xyz Change.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:48.470
Appear, Rank 5 Raidraptor — Blaze Falcon!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:52.440
Have you forgotten Amazoness Hall's effect?

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.680
Fools who never learn must die...

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:59.250
I attack Blaze Falcon with 
Amazoness Empress!

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:11.290
The effect of Equip Spell 
Raidraptor — Iron Heart,

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:14.490
sent to the graveyard with Rise Falcon, activates!

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:17.740
The destroyed Blaze Falcon is 
used as an Xyz component,

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:21.420
to Special Summon Rise Falcon.

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:26.610
Again? At this point, what 
can you accomplish?

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.880
He's really getting on my nerves.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:32.750
Why not just give up and become 
a card like your allies?

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:36.360
Give up?

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:40.850
The Resistance knows no such words.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.860
I will avenge my allies.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:45.290
I will steal back my sister.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.200
I will destroy Academia...

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.670
Until then, I will never give up!

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:51.770
Syun...

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:52.860
That's right.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:57.640
Until we seize final victory, we'll keep fighting.

00:14:58.150 --> 00:14:59.080
Ute...

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:04.800
Even if you don't give up, you'll be 
finished on Grace's turn.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.110
I now end my turn.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:10.410
Let's go, Yuya... It's our turn!

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:13.060
Wait. Calm down, Ute.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.850
I am calm!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:17.580
No! You're a slave to your anger.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:20.530
Thinking of your allies who are 
now cards, that's reasonable.

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:23.030
But if you become a slave to anger,

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:27.000
that unknown thing will swallow you this time!

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:32.190
Ute... Kurosaki... Leave this to me.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:35.680
I swear I'll do what you need me to do!

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:42.060
Very well. I'll leave it to you, Yuya.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:46.990
Thanks, Ute... Kurosaki.

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:49.690
My turn!

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:51.900
I got it!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:55.100
I use the Pendulum Scale already set,

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.780
to Pendulum Summon!

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:58.990
Be reborn from my Extra Deck!

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:01.660
Xiangsheng Magician!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.370
He never learns!

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:07.750
Special Summoning increases our life! 
How many times must I tell you?

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.710
I activate my spell card Monster Reborn.

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:15.920
I Special Summon Raidraptor — 
Singing Lanius from my graveyard.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.890
Again?

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:23.640
I overlay Xiangsheng Magician 
and Singing Lanius!

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.630
From the black darkness,

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:33.870
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:35.570
Xyz Summon!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:39.750
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:43.660
This isn't even funny...

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.400
Their life points...

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.950
Over 10,000.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:50.700
With numbers like that...

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.920
...how will they win?

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:57.870
If you don't want to duel, 
why not simply surrender?!

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:00.130
I'll turn you into a card first!

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:01.690
Now, now...

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:06.080
Yuya, in this situation, how do you 
intend to chip away 10,000 life?

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.730
I can do it.

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:10.510
With your, my, and Kurosaki's 
power together.

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:11.840
Our power?

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.010
And...

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:16.980
Dad's, too.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:22.420
Commander! What's wrong?

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:26.300
Yusyo Sakaki's son is in this dimension.

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:28.800
We may be able to draw conclusions 
from his duel record.

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:29.890
Investigate at once.

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:30.910
Yes, sir!

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.800
I don't see Noro anywhere...

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:39.270
Y-Yes, sir! Sub-commander Noro 
is out on urgent business!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.510
Urgent business?

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:45.310
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:47.450
It's time for the climax!

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:50.770
Our opponents have more 
than 10,000 life points.

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:53.930
If I can deplete them, I'd like 
a round of applause!

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:55.210
Deplete them?

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:57.850
Have you forgotten Amazoness 
Magic Mirror's effect?

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:00.390
We can negate battle damage, you know.

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:02.690
Of course I remember...

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:05.860
But entertainment means making 
the impossible possible.

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:08.500
First, I'll set the stage.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:12.040
I activate my Continuous Spell 
Miracle Rocket Show!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:14.920
What is this?

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:17.310
Hey, that's pretty.

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:20.270
On this turn, this card's effect

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:24.520
negates your monsters' destruction 
by battle, rendering damage to 0.

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:27.990
Then how will you win?

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:30.160
Just wait and see.

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:34.440
Now, the spell card that's the key 
to the next generation of shows...

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:36.230
Smile World!

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:38.200
Where did Noro go?!

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:40.140
W-Well, I—

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:43.770
Commander, we're reading 
a major duel in progress.

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:48.530
Smile World's activation increases 
the attack points of all monsters

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:51.650
on the field by the number 
of monsters times 100...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:54.120
In other words, 400!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.620
Smile World...

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.050
He's increasing all of their attack points?

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:01.590
Is this a joke?

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:03.040
Absolutely not.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.330
This is all preparation.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.560
And once everything is set...

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:13.760
I use one of Rise Falcon's Overlay 
Units to activate its effect!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:18.470
Its attack points increase by the 
sum of Amazoness Empress

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:21.180
and Amazoness Pet Liger's attack points!

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:25.020
Ute, you see it, right?

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:26.780
Yeah, let's go!

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:30.980
I activate Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon's effect!

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:35.370
I use one Overlay Unit to, 
until the end of this turn,

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:40.350
halve the attack points of one 
monster on the field,

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:43.990
and add that amount to those 
of Dark Rebellion.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.070
Treason Discharge!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.500
And I use the other Overlay Unit.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:52.710
Treason Discharge!

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:59.680
Syun and Ute's monsters' attack 
points have gone up, but...

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:03.150
It won't matter. Your attacks 
are still negated!

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:07.420
The fun is only getting started!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:10.970
Rise Falcon has 6600 attack points.

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:14.390
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon 
has 5075 attack points.

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:17.860
Now, pay very close attention 
to those attack points!

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:21.610
The target is Amazoness Pet Liger, 
whose attack points

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.290
are down to 725!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.780
Here it comes!

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:26.770
Three.

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:28.110
Two.

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:29.740
One.

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:31.080
Fire!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:39.550
Whoa...

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:40.490
Amazing.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.190
It's very pretty.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.160
Cool!

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.740
But the damage is 0!

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:04.940
And Miracle Rocket Show's last effect.

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.540
After battle,

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:10.350
it deals the total battle damage 
this card reduced to 0...

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:15.580
in other words, 10,225... to you!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.340
What?

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:19.470
No way!

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:23.330
He won.

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:27.810
He really took out all that 
enemy life at once!

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:28.600
Yuya!

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:34.130
Did you enjoy that, everyone?

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:38.540
This is the entertainment duel, 
handed down by Yusyo Sakaki.

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:41.010
Yusyo Sakaki...

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:43.090
I'm moving out at once!

00:21:43.090 --> 00:21:44.980
All troops in headquarters, with me!

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:51.450
A duel... A duel like that...

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:53.230
It was amazing.

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:56.160
What are you doing?

00:21:56.160 --> 00:22:00.380
How can the great Tyler sisters 
just let the Lancers run off?

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:02.460
After them. They can't have gone—

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:03.300
No.

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:07.500
The Professor has ordered 
us to finish them.

00:22:08.710 --> 00:22:11.520
The Obelisk Force... Why?

00:23:49.690 --> 00:23:51.130
That Yuya boy...

00:23:51.130 --> 00:23:55.720
What kind of entertainment duel will he 
show us against the Obelisk Force?

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:57.610
I can't wait to see.

00:23:57.610 --> 00:24:00.780
I don't think your entertainment 
will get through to them, but...

00:24:00.780 --> 00:24:03.930
Even so, I'll go forward with my duel,

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:06.010
the duel my father taught me!

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:08.060
Then do it, without regret.

00:24:08.060 --> 00:24:10.290
I'll move forward with my duel, too.

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:15.150
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Falcon That Falls on the Battlefield.

00:24:15.150 --> 00:24:17.230
The fun is only getting started!
